+## Moving v1 data over
+
+v1 kept data in the browser it ran in. To bring habit history into your account:
 
-**Design tokens** live as CSS variables in `index.css` and are exposed to
-Tailwind through `@theme inline`, so dark mode is just a `.dark` class swap.
-Category accents (`sage`, `dusk`, `mauve`, `sand`, `teal`, `clay`) each have a
-line colour and a soft fill tuned separately for light and dark.
+1. Open `legacy/stillpoint-v1.html`, then **⋯ → Download a backup**.
+2. In v2, open the avatar menu and choose **Import a v1 backup file**.
 
-**Accessibility:** real checkboxes, radios and switches with labels; visible
-focus rings; `aria-live` toasts; `prefers-reduced-motion` respected.
+Habits are matched by name, so history lands on the existing habit, and
+importing twice adds nothing. Study sessions and exams aren't imported, since
+those features were removed.
